    "detailed_description": "In this exciting adventure set in the nano universe, control a biological cell and engage in battles with other cells. Genome Warriors: Resistance to Invasion invites you to a survival challenge in a microscopic world.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nIn this roguelike top-down shooter game, progress by defeating enemies in randomly generated levels. Upgrade your cell, gain advantages with temporary boosts, and try different strategies each time.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nTo survive in this microscopic world, you must be quick and smart. Can you overcome the challenges and defeat the most dangerous enemies in the nano universe?<br />\r\n<br />\r\nAre you ready for the battle for victory?",
